## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be word64(parseInt(item 2 of arguments)).
Let total be word64(0).
Let i be word64(1).
While i is at most n:
    Let k be i.
    While k is not word64(1):
        If k % word64(2) equals word64(0):
            Set k to k / word64(2).
        Otherwise:
            Set k to word64(3) * k + word64(1).
        Set total to total + word64(1).
    Set i to i + word64(1).
Show total.
